1887	1988	1885	1885	Tuppence	13	“ To resume , that was in a way the apex of my career . I next entered a Government office . We had several very enjoyable tea parties . I had intended to become a land girl , a postwoman , and a bus conductress by way of rounding off my career -- but the Armistice intervened ! I clung to the office with the true limpet touch for many long months , but , alas , I was combed out at last . Since then I ’ve been looking for a job . Now then -- your turn . ”
